Subject: [PATCH] Add voice-triggered screen unlock (PIN, password, pattern)

- UnlockCredentialStore: encrypted storage for the screen-lock credential
- ScreenUnlocker: wakes the screen, reveals the lock UI and enters the
  credential through the accessibility service, limited to system UI windows,
  one entry per call, lock-out protection after repeated failures
- ScreenUnlockActivity + Settings row: save lock type/credential, voice-match
  switch, lock-and-test button
- unlock_device Gemini tool gated by an explicit unlock phrase and a real
  owner-voice match for the current turn
- Fix requestScreenWake(): it referenced a non-existent MainActivity class;
  now uses a wake lock

